  "scope": [
    "Clan banner occupies its own row in every view; chat input and settings Save remain reachable. Rounded chat/tables and themed panels follow the home view. Treasury deposits wrap on small screens.",
    "Audited clan transactions and calendar settlement share immutable member/battle ledgers via clan-draft. Every other and unknown future field remains private. Generic callbacks retain full isolation.",
    "New static boundary check requires explicit affected profiles for production transactWorld callers; development contract documents atomic writes and proportional verification."
  ],
