    "reviewed": [
      "ProfileStore arena/lobby/world drafts and publication order",
      "Three production transactWorld callers: clans, gifts/marriage, promo codes",
      "Clan ledger writers, calendar settlement and validators",
      "WAL/delta/checkpoint, immutable fragments and PostgreSQL IPC",
      "Profile histories and purchase/achievement/inventory recovery coverage"
    ],
    "findings": [
      "Production world commands already use bounded write sets. The complete-world generic fallback remains for arbitrary isolated callbacks; it is not invoked by the three game handlers.",
      "copyRecord copies table references, not all nested profiles. Single-player actions still create one private profile draft. Existing receipt/history sharing is preserved.",
      "Full reads for cold start, migrations, recovery, verification and backups remain deliberate. PostgreSQL worker receives a pinned snapshot descriptor; optional full-world/room prototypes stay disabled.",
      "Other structuredClone sites include isolated auth state, one player remnant, reward/UI projections, event manifests, season metadata and testing tools; they are not all full-world clones."
    ]
  },
